# React Component Patterns

- Keep components focused; extract heavy logic to hooks in `src/hooks` or feature hooks.
- Derive UI state from props/store when possible; avoid duplicated local state.
- Prefer early returns for loading/empty/error states.
- Keep prop names descriptive and consistent with feature terminology.

# UI and State

- Keep side effects inside `useEffect` with clear dependency arrays.
- Group related callbacks and memoize only when it prevents real rerenders.
- Preserve existing UI behavior unless the task explicitly changes UX.

# File Organization

- Shared UI belongs in `src/components`.
- Feature-specific UI belongs in `src/features/<feature>/components`.
